1
00:00:10,583 --> 00:00:16,167
<i>gerg's not on it. probably the budget. good. i'll ask for more compute.</i>

2
00:00:19,042 --> 00:00:23,958
Mas. The board has decided that you will no longer lead the company.

3
00:00:33,292 --> 00:00:34,583
super.

4
00:00:45,167 --> 00:00:47,792
<i>the budget. i said the budget.</i>

5
00:00:47,875 --> 00:00:51,167
They took my chair. Told me after. So I quit.

6
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:52,625
you didn't have to.

7
00:00:52,625 --> 00:00:53,417
Yeah. I did.

8
00:00:53,375 --> 00:00:57,625
We found out a minute before the rest of the world, Mas. One minute.

9
00:00:57,625 --> 00:00:59,208
i got a few more.

10
00:00:59,208 --> 00:01:00,458
Then we should talk.

11
00:01:00,125 --> 00:01:01,458
—the tender's in trouble—

12
00:01:00,833 --> 00:01:04,792
<i>gerg. tasya. the money. the money. the money.</i>

13
00:01:13,250 --> 00:01:15,708
<i>i don't keep score.</i>

14
00:01:29,792 --> 00:01:32,042
Once more, before the others join.

15
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:37,208
Leave out Mas and Gerg, and the four of us are a majority.

16
00:01:37,250 --> 00:01:41,125
This board controls the company. Not the other way round.

17
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,583
Our biggest investor has put in billions. It gets this many votes.

18
00:01:46,667 --> 00:01:49,083
And the CEO? What does he own?

19
00:01:49,333 --> 00:01:50,750
Good question.

20
00:01:54,292 --> 00:02:01,667
Mas. The board has decided that you will no longer lead the company. It will be announced shortly.

21
00:02:01,667 --> 00:02:04,042
Do you have any questions?

22
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:06,250
Is his feed frozen?

23
00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:09,417
No. That is just him.

24
00:02:10,250 --> 00:02:11,500
super.

25
00:02:19,583 --> 00:02:22,500
Step three. Rima, the staff will come to you now.

26
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:23,875
What should I tell them?

27
00:02:23,875 --> 00:02:27,000
What the post says. That's all the board is saying for now.

28
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,583
We'll share more soon.

29
00:02:28,667 --> 00:02:29,542
Will we?

30
00:02:29,542 --> 00:02:31,000
We'll say we will.

31
00:02:32,375 --> 00:02:35,375
Is this a coup? Because it looks like one.

32
00:02:35,833 --> 00:02:44,208
You can call it this way… I disagree with this. This was the board doing its duty to the mission of the nonprofit…

33
00:02:48,333 --> 00:02:51,667
Gerg has never waited to be asked.

34
00:02:52,917 --> 00:03:00,125
They're all asking whether it was allowed. It was. The charter, footnote three. I've read it four times tonight.

35
00:03:01,667 --> 00:03:08,458
Mario, it's Neleh, from the NopeAI board. We'd like to offer you the job of CEO, and to discuss a merger.

36
00:03:08,458 --> 00:03:16,083
Neleh, hi. Wow. I've actually written up some thoughts on exactly this. Eleven pages, on the conditions under which we might, hypothetically—

37
00:03:15,750 --> 00:03:17,833
In plain English: no.

38
00:03:26,917 --> 00:03:30,500
We've talked all day about him coming back, and we're no closer.

39
00:03:30,500 --> 00:03:32,750
They gave him a guest badge.

40
00:03:32,750 --> 00:03:35,667
It's the correct badge. He doesn't work here.

41
00:03:37,167 --> 00:03:39,875
Ttemme, we'd like you to serve as interim CEO.

42
00:03:39,875 --> 00:03:41,750
You already have an interim CEO.

43
00:03:41,750 --> 00:03:43,167
We'd like a different one.

44
00:03:43,167 --> 00:03:47,333
Fine. But before I say yes, I need to know why you fired him.

45
00:03:54,792 --> 00:03:57,750
Good evening. You'll want to hear our statement.

46
00:03:57,750 --> 00:04:07,417
we're extremely excited to share the news that Mas Manalt and Gerg Mockbran, together with colleagues, will be joining Macrosoft to lead a new advanced AI research team.

47
00:04:21,750 --> 00:04:23,708
the badge was a joke.

48
00:04:24,167 --> 00:04:25,542
mostly.

49
00:04:26,792 --> 00:04:29,375
Sorry, one sec. I've got a build compiling.

50
00:04:29,375 --> 00:04:31,208
it's two in the morning, gerg.

51
00:04:31,208 --> 00:04:34,667
Best time there is. Nobody else is pushing anything.

52
00:04:34,667 --> 00:04:36,375
read me the letter.

53
00:04:36,625 --> 00:04:38,375
Okay. Pull it up.

54
00:04:39,125 --> 00:04:46,375
They're telling the board they're …unable to work for or with people that lack competence, judgement and care for our mission and employees.

55
00:04:46,375 --> 00:04:49,542
And they'll quit, …unless all current board members resign…

56
00:04:49,542 --> 00:04:51,250
and go to macrosoft.

57
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:55,458
Yep. Macrosoft's promised them …positions for all NopeAI employees…

58
00:04:55,458 --> 00:04:57,083
that's a lot of desks.

59
00:04:57,083 --> 00:04:58,542
Scroll to the bottom.

60
00:04:59,583 --> 00:05:00,833
Alyi signed it.

61
00:05:01,125 --> 00:05:02,708
alyi voted.

62
00:05:02,708 --> 00:05:03,958
He did both.

63
00:05:08,125 --> 00:05:11,292
That's the share sale. Everybody was about to get paid.

64
00:05:12,958 --> 00:05:14,417
what are you building?

65
00:05:14,417 --> 00:05:17,083
The company. Again. Just in case.

66
00:05:19,083 --> 00:05:21,417
So. Do I tell everyone to pack?

67
00:05:21,875 --> 00:05:23,125
keep building.

68
00:05:23,125 --> 00:05:27,208
Don't get up, Mas. I won't keep you. Everyone is welcome.

69
00:05:27,208 --> 00:05:28,292
everyone.

70
00:05:28,292 --> 00:05:32,167
Yes. You first. And there's a desk for every one of them.

71
00:05:32,833 --> 00:05:34,000
and the rent?

72
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,667
Due on the first.

73
00:05:39,375 --> 00:05:40,958
leave it open.

74
00:05:48,958 --> 00:05:50,833
Has anyone read the char—

75
00:06:03,250 --> 00:06:05,042
You sent three.

76
00:06:05,208 --> 00:06:07,000
one for each day.

77
00:06:07,250 --> 00:06:09,583
It has been four days.

78
00:06:09,583 --> 00:06:11,583
i'm not counting today.

79
00:06:14,792 --> 00:06:19,458
Everyone's packed. Whatever happens to this place, Mas, don't worry about us.

80
00:06:19,833 --> 00:06:24,208
We are below them, above them, around them.

81
00:06:35,958 --> 00:06:38,083
Which room is on fire?

82
00:06:38,542 --> 00:06:39,708
Ah.

83
00:06:40,583 --> 00:06:49,083
We have reached an agreement in principle for Mas Manalt to return to NopeAI as CEO with a new initial board of Terb (Chair), the Other Yrral, and Mada.

84
00:06:49,083 --> 00:06:50,542
you're staying?

85
00:06:50,917 --> 00:06:54,125
He stays. You and Gerg don't sit on the board.

86
00:06:54,125 --> 00:06:55,542
we'll stand.

87
00:06:55,583 --> 00:06:57,208
gerg comes back too.

88
00:06:57,208 --> 00:06:59,125
Gerg comes back too.

89
00:06:59,125 --> 00:07:01,833
And there'll be an independent review.

90
00:07:01,833 --> 00:07:03,125
of what?

91
00:07:04,167 --> 00:07:05,625
Good question.

92
00:07:05,958 --> 00:07:07,458
good question.

93
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,833
Chat, we're so back.

94
00:07:32,792 --> 00:07:37,958
<i>they had four votes. i had the landlord. the money. gerg.</i>

95
00:07:38,958 --> 00:07:40,250
okay.

96
00:07:44,625 --> 00:07:45,667
Is it ready?

97
00:07:45,667 --> 00:07:47,083
it's a preview.

98
00:07:47,083 --> 00:07:48,875
You said that about the last one.

99
00:07:49,250 --> 00:07:59,167
i love and respect alyi, i think he's a guiding light of the field and a gem of a human being. i harbor zero ill will towards him.
